(7066887, 1074685, 9581, '<td valign="top">"Plant Life"<br/>I''d rather waltz than just walk through the forest,<br/>The trees keep the tempo and they sway in time,<br/>Quartet of crickets chime in for the chorus,<br/>If I were to pluck on your heartstrings would you strum on mine?</td>', '"Plant Life"I''d rather waltz than just walk through the forest,The trees keep the tempo and they sway in time,Quartet of crickets chime in for the chorus,If I were to pluck on your heartstrings would you strum on mine?', '2013-07-11 11:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7066888, 1075021, 138630, '<td valign="top">Bloom Where You Are Planted<br/>I just love the feel of this -the golden wheat, the green field beyond, the cluster of daisies.  Not crazy about the white bokeh at the top but that''s just me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Bloom Where You Are PlantedI just love the feel of this -the golden wheat, the green field beyond, the cluster of daisies.  Not crazy about the white bokeh at the top but that''s just me.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-07-11 11:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7066890, 1074993, 138630, '<td valign="top">War Torn<br/>Fascinating play of geometric shapes and the tattered flag adds the suggestion of a story to be told.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'War TornFascinating play of geometric shapes and the tattered flag adds the suggestion of a story to be told.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-07-11 11:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
