(7066892, 1075007, 9581, '<td valign="top">"Shark Attack" by Limp Bizkit<br/>Shut it down<br/>Just shut it down<br/>Swimming with sharks ain''t easy<br/>They just want to kill and eat me<br/>I ain''t gonna let that happen<br/>Watch me plan my shark attack<br/>Make them wish they never knew me<br/>Turn their grey-white-ass to sushi<br/>This is my old-school technique<br/>It''s all I need to lead them on peace<br/> <br/>Still shockin'' like a heart attack<br/>Cause I''m a maniac (Cause I''m a maniac)<br/>Still running through the shark attack<br/>Without a single scratch (Without a single scratch)<br/>Still limpin'' where the dog is at<br/>Up in my brainiac (Up in my brainiac)<br/>Still bitin'' while your barkin'' back<br/>So you can shut your trap</td>', '"Shark Attack" by Limp BizkitShut it downJust shut it downSwimming with sharks ain''t easyThey just want to kill and eat meI ain''t gonna let that happenWatch me plan my shark attackMake them wish they never knew meTurn their grey-white-ass to sushiThis is my old-school techniqueIt''s all I need to lead them on peace Still shockin'' like a heart attackCause I''m a maniac (Cause I''m a maniac)Still running through the shark attackWithout a single scratch (Without a single scratch)Still limpin'' where the dog is atUp in my brainiac (Up in my brainiac)Still bitin'' while your barkin'' backSo you can shut your trap', '2013-07-11 11:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
