(7069222, 1074787, 100831, '<td valign="top">it''s all good.<br/> <br/>I''ve been back to this image over and over... and it''s got me hooked now. There''s something so interesting about her carefreeness.. but she''s obviously engaged, just at her own pace. I''m totally bumping this. Love the conversion too... the blurred vignetting works perfectly (sorry if I''m wrong about how you achieved the look but I like it).</td>', 'it''s all good. I''ve been back to this image over and over... and it''s got me hooked now. There''s something so interesting about her carefreeness.. but she''s obviously engaged, just at her own pace. I''m totally bumping this. Love the conversion too... the blurred vignetting works perfectly (sorry if I''m wrong about how you achieved the look but I like it).', '2013-07-13 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
