(7069787, 1074966, 138630, '<td valign="top">Small Spaces: Workspace of the Week<br/>I love the composition and interest here - keep wishing there was less color on the left and just a bit on the right.  Maybe desaturate the blue in the background on the poster and then find a way to pick up the yellow on the right (maybe the door handles?)  Fascinating shot with both compositional and human interest.<br/>Voted earlier, back to title.</td>', 'Small Spaces: Workspace of the WeekI love the composition and interest here - keep wishing there was less color on the left and just a bit on the right.  Maybe desaturate the blue in the background on the poster and then find a way to pick up the yellow on the right (maybe the door handles?)  Fascinating shot with both compositional and human interest.Voted earlier, back to title.', '2013-07-14 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
