(7072676, 1075028, 72134, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all these fine suggestions. Many of them are soething about wild horses, but the problem is. These horses are not wild at all -they are all tame. I cut the riders off in the front and back. These are spare horses used in long horse trips in Iceland where you must change horse at least two times a day. This one was taken in south Iceland not far from Eyjafjallajökull. But -Wild horses- sounds well.</td>', 'Thanks for all these fine suggestions. Many of them are soething about wild horses, but the problem is. These horses are not wild at all -they are all tame. I cut the riders off in the front and back. These are spare horses used in long horse trips in Iceland where you must change horse at least two times a day. This one was taken in south Iceland not far from Eyjafjallajökull. But -Wild horses- sounds well.', '2013-07-17 04:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
